gametake a screenshot of the endscreen with your time visible!post it in the #🏆demo-challenge channelThe competition is fierce but why not give it a try? You can still enter until the end of Steam Next Fest on Monday the 26th at 10AM PDT or 18 CET ⏰🏆 The 3 teams with the best time will win the opportunity to get their own custom ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:30:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039529","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:33:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1846651706677155","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"5k+ Demo Players","summary":"Over 5000 people have played the Tandem Together demo so far!!! 🥳🎉Thank you so much to everyone who's played our game! We hope you had fun and haven't lost all your friends in the process 🙂‍↕️Stay tuned for news about Steam Next Fest and an update for our demo coming real soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:42:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677155","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1846018067936238","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"Release Date Announcement!","summary":"SAVE THE DATE! Tandem Together is coming december 8th this year!! 😱🎉🚴Thank you so much to everyone who played the demo, wishlisted the game or supported us in any way shape or form 😭❤️We are super excited to see this community grow and help us develop the best game we can! We know the release is still a little ways away but we hope it'll be worth the wait with new drugs and levels coming, so stay tuned! We'll keep you updated along the way.So until then, keep riding, take part in our best-time-c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T13:08:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936238","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1844751498234297","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.5.1","summary":"Hi riders, the demo release yesterday went surprisingly smoothly and we are happy to see so many of you play our game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T13:44:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1844751498231304","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"Tandem Together Demo is Live!","summary":"Tandem Together Demo is Now Live on Steam!After probably a few too many deaths ourselves, the Tandem Together Demo is finally here.We’re really proud of how far the game has come and very grateful for all the positive feedback we’ve received so far. A lot of work went into getting the demo ready, and we’re excited to finally see more of you jump in, play together, crash together, and hopefully have a good time.To celebrate the demo release, we’re also running a small challenge.Demo ChallengeFini","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T12:05:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1844751498224635","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release","summary":"Hello riders!! Change of plans. Sadly we're dropping the playtest because for some reason we're still having issues with getting it approved :(So instead we'll be giving you access to the full demo next monday (Sep 28th) !!! Then you'll finally get to play our game and tell us about all the bugs you've found and how to best break our game 🙂‍↕️SO EXCITEEEED!!1Here's a sneak peak of what's to come ‍👀","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T13:55:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1844115010488900","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Testing","summary":"Hey everyone!We were planning to launch the Tandem Together Playtest today, but unfortunately we’ve run into a small delay.The playtest is currently still waiting for approval from steam, which means we can’t start it just yet.Everything on our side is ready, and we’re aiming to go live asap. As soon as we have confirmation, we’ll post another update here.Thanks for your patience, and we’re really looking forward to finally seeing you play Tandem Together! 💛See you soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:54:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1843481262704412","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Testing","summary":"Hey everyone!🗓️ Tomorrow the official Tandem Together Beta Testing starts! Be one of the first to test and play our game! Join the discord to leave suggestions, give feedback and help us develop the best game we can 🚴‍♂️🚴‍♀️🚴Be ready tomorrow (Sep 16.) at:⏰2:00 PM CEST | 8:00 AM EDT | 8:00 PM CSTThe testing ends on Sep 20. so if you have a couple minutes of free time, go check out Tandem Together!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T12:16:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036280-1841579228675393","game_id":"steam-5036280","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing TANDEM TOGETHER!!!","summary":"🚨 THE TANDEM TOGETHER STEAM PAGE IS LIVE 🚨 🚴🚴‍♀️🚴‍♂️Hello there! We are two small indie studios from Hamburg Germany working on this whacky little title and we hope you'll enjoy it 💙💛Is Tandem Together for you? Do you have a friend? Just one friend?? No? That's embarrassing. Well bad luck, because for this game you need two idiots to ride a tandem bike through increasingly treatcherous terrains and take -errm I mean- deliver drugs (or candy if you don't want mommy to see) on the way. Because wha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T12:30:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675393","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5036280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5036280":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5036280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z"},"5271120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:27Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"g